The target is 5.
The working is a list of 1.
The size is 1, while the nextsize is 0.
Keep a shared next as an empty list of whole numbers.
To prune from position (a whole number).
Repeat while the number of items in next is more than 0.
Remove the last item from next.

Repeat while size is less than target.
Prune from 0.
Set nextsize to 0.
For every step from 0 to (size times 2) minus 1.
The source is step modulo size.
The value is item source of working.
The doubled is value times 2.
The candidate is doubled.
If step is less than size, set candidate to doubled minus 1.
If candidate is at most target, Place candidate into next, add 1 to nextsize.
If step is (size times 2) minus 1, set working to next, set size to nextsize.

For each value in working, show value.
